            "body": "<img width=\"899\" alt=\"keymap\" src=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/assets/1897340/e255cb35-b3c5-43d6-8566-416d732d87fe\">\r\n\r\nLooks like `<C-R>` is registered for minibracked. I've tried mapping paste to `<C-V>`, still not working. am I missing something? 🤔 ",
