                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                        "login": "echasnovski",
                        "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                        "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Mappings inside 'mini.pick' are not the same as general purpose mappings (created with `vim.keymap.set()` and friends). There is [`<C-r>` inside 'mini.pick'](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/2e2931b3822bf357d2f69cbc0bcb2d99a3f0d4c8/doc/mini-pick.txt#L710) to paste from register. System register is one of `+` or `*`.\r\n\r\nSo posting from system register is supposed to be done with `<C-r>+` (or `<C-r>*`) when 'mini.pick' is active.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Mappings inside 'mini.pick' are not the same as general purpose mappings (created with <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.keymap.set()</code> and friends). There is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/2e2931b3822bf357d2f69cbc0bcb2d99a3f0d4c8/doc/mini-pick.txt#L710\"><code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-r&gt;</code> inside 'mini.pick'</a> to paste from register. System register is one of <code class=\"notranslate\">+</code> or <code class=\"notranslate\">*</code>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">So posting from system register is supposed to be done with <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-r&gt;+</code> (or <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;C-r&gt;*</code>) when 'mini.pick' is active.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Mappings inside 'mini.pick' are not the same as general purpose mappings (created with vim.keymap.set() and friends). There is <C-r> inside 'mini.pick' to paste from register. System register is one of + or *.\nSo posting from system register is supposed to be done with <C-r>+ (or <C-r>*) when 'mini.pick' is active.",
